<title>ITALY: BOBSLEIGH-RESULTS OF WORLD CUP TWO-MAN EVENT.</title>
<headline>BOBSLEIGH-RESULTS OF WORLD CUP TWO-MAN EVENT.</headline>
<dateline>CORTINA D'AMPEZZO, Italy 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a World Cup two-man bobsleigh event on Saturday.</p>
<p>1. United States III (Brian Shimer, Robert Olesen) one minute, 49.11 seconds</p>
<p>2. Italy I (Guenther Huber, Antonio Tartaglia) 1:49.2</p>
<p>3. Germany I (Sepp Dostthaler, Olaf Hampel) 1:49.52.</p>
</text>
